OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious administrative error' in 
OL,4,Aelection count                         
OL,6,FThe original vote count for a          
OL,7,Fconstituency in the Isle of Man's      
OL,8,Fgeneral election contained a "very     
OL,9,Fserious administrative error", with    
OL,10,Fsome ballots uncounted and others      
OL,11,Fwrongly allocated, a report has found. 
OL,13,FA supervised recount of the Onchan     
OL,14,Fballots was carried out last week after
OL,15,FJulie Edge, who lost her seat in       
OL,16,FSeptember's poll, lodged a petition    
OL,17,Fcalling for the election to declared   
OL,18,Fvoid.                                  
OL,20,FThe recount found the number of votes  
OL,21,Fchanged for five of the six candidates 
OL,22,Fwho stood.                             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
